cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: suite2p
abstract: 'Motion correction, ROI detection, cell classification and fluorescence/neuropil extraction
  of two-photon calcium imaging movies with Suite2p 1.x, packaged as a Pennsieve processor: TIFF/BigTIFF
  (incl. ScanImage), HDF5, NWB and Bruker input, frame times on the session clock, Suite2p''s standard
  output folders, QC figures, and a comparison with reference ROIs from a companion NWB.'
